OL,3,A'I lost my savings after a job
OL,4,Ainterview scam'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a horrible feeling to be out a
OL,7,Fsubstantial amount - something I
OL,8,Fwouldn't wish on my worst enemy," the
OL,9,Fvictim, who wanted to stay anonymous,
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
