OL,3,AOasis fans hope for Celtic Park gigs
OL,4,Aafter cracking clues in chip shop video
OL,5,
OL,6,FOasis fans have uncovered a set of
OL,7,Fcryptic clues in a promo video from the
OL,8,Fband, suggesting that they will stage
OL,9,Fgigs at Celtic Park in Glasgow next
OL,10,Fyear.
OL,12,FThe Manchester rockers released the
OL,13,F23-second teaser on their social media
OL,14,Faccounts, showing two boys in what
OL,15,Fappears to be a Scottish chip shop.
OL,17,FInternet sleuths spotted sets of
OL,18,Fnumbers in posters around the chippy
OL,19,Fwhich they worked out to be the map
OL,20,Fco-ordinates for Celtic's Parkhead
OL,21,Fstadium.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
